// REJECTS: Unexpected token 'unquotedId'
//
// `id:` on a generation node takes a STRING -- `nodeId: NODE_ID COLON STRING SEMI_COLON`.
// The identical-looking `id:` inside an ExternalFormat schema entry takes a bare identifier,
// and `key:`/`title:` elsewhere take strings, so there is no rule to infer.
//
// A rewritten parser with one "identifier or string" scalar accepts both spellings
// everywhere and diverges silently on exactly this.
